#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:1
msgid "Import to IntelliJ IDEA"
msgstr ""
"导入到 IntelliJ IDEA"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:9
msgid "Objective"
msgstr ""
"目标"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:12
msgid "I want to import sbt build to IntelliJ IDEA."
msgstr ""
"我想将 sbt 构建导入 IntelliJ IDEA。"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:14
msgid "Steps"
msgstr ""
"步骤"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:17
msgid ""
"[IntelliJ IDEA](https://www.jetbrains.com/idea/) is an IDE created by "
"JetBrains, and the Community Edition is open source under Apache v2 license. "
"IntelliJ integrates with many build tools, including sbt, to import the "
"project."
msgstr ""
"[IntelliJ IDEA](https://www.jetbrains.com/idea/) 是 JetBrains 开发的 IDE，Community Edition 在 Apache v2 "
"许可证下开源。IntelliJ 可与多种构建工具（包括 sbt）集成以导入项目。"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:19
msgid "To import a build to IntelliJ IDEA:"
msgstr ""
"要将构建导入 IntelliJ IDEA："

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:21
msgid ""
"Install Scala plugin on the Plugins tab:<br> ![IntelliJ](../files/"
"intellij1.png)"
msgstr ""
"在插件页安装 Scala 插件：<br> ![IntelliJ](../files/intellij1.png)"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:23
msgid ""
"From Projects, open a directory containing a `build.sbt` file.<br> !"
"[IntelliJ](../files/intellij2.png)"
msgstr ""
"在「项目」中打开包含 `build.sbt` 文件的目录。<br> ![IntelliJ](../files/intellij2.png)"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:25
msgid ""
"Once the import process is complete, open a Scala file to see that code "
"completion works."
msgstr ""
"导入完成后，打开 Scala 文件以确认代码补全可用。"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:27
msgid ""
"IntelliJ Scala plugin uses its own lightweight compilation engine to detect "
"errors, which is fast but sometimes incorrect. Per [compiler-based "
"highlighting](https://blog.jetbrains.com/scala/2021/07/27/intellij-scala-"
"plugin-2021-2/#Compiler-based_highlighting), IntelliJ can be configured to "
"use the Scala compiler for error highlighting."
msgstr ""
"IntelliJ Scala 插件使用自带的轻量编译引擎检测错误，速度快但有时不准确。按 [compiler-based "
"highlighting](https://blog.jetbrains.com/scala/2021/07/27/intellij-scala-plugin-2021-2/#Compiler-based_highlighting) 所述，"
"可将 IntelliJ 配置为使用 Scala 编译器进行错误高亮。"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:29
msgid "Interactive debugging with IntelliJ IDEA"
msgstr ""
"使用 IntelliJ IDEA 交互式调试"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:31
msgid ""
"IntelliJ supports interactive debugging by setting break points in the code:"
"<br> ![IntelliJ](../files/intellij4.png)"
msgstr ""
"IntelliJ 支持在代码中设置断点进行交互式调试：<br> ![IntelliJ](../files/intellij4.png)"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:33
msgid ""
"Interactive debugging can be started by right-clicking on an unit test, and "
"selecting \"Debug '\\<test name\\>'.\" Alternatively, you can click the "
"green \"run\" icon on the left part of the editor near the unit test. When "
"the test hits a break point, you can inspect the values of the variables:"
"<br> ![IntelliJ](../files/intellij5.png)"
msgstr ""
"您可在单元测试上右键，选择 \"Debug '\\<test name\\>'.\" 也可点击编辑器左侧单元测试旁的绿色 \"run\" 图标。"
"测试命中断点时，可查看变量取值：<br> ![IntelliJ](../files/intellij5.png)"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:37
msgid ""
"See [Debug Code](https://www.jetbrains.com/help/idea/debugging-code.html) "
"page on IntelliJ documentation for more details on how to navigate an "
"interactive debugging session."
msgstr ""
"交互式调试会话中的操作方式，详见 IntelliJ 文档中的 [Debug Code](https://www.jetbrains.com/help/idea/debugging-code.html) 页面。"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:39
msgid "Alternative"
msgstr ""
"其他方式"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:42
msgid "Using sbt as IntelliJ IDEA build server (advanced)"
msgstr ""
"将 sbt 用作 IntelliJ IDEA 构建服务器（进阶）"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:44
msgid ""
"Importing the build to IntelliJ means that you're effectively using IntelliJ "
"as the build tool and the compiler while you code (see also [compiler-based "
"highlighting](https://blog.jetbrains.com/scala/2021/07/27/intellij-scala-"
"plugin-2021-2/#Compiler-based_highlighting)). While many users are happy "
"with the experience, depending on the code base some of the compilation "
"errors may be false, it may not work well with plugins that generate "
"sources, and generally you might want to code with the identical build "
"semantics as sbt. Thankfully, modern IntelliJ supports alternative _build "
"servers_ including sbt via the [Build Server Protocol](https://build-server-"
"protocol.github.io/) (BSP)."
msgstr ""
"将构建导入 IntelliJ 意味着编码时实际以 IntelliJ 作为构建工具与编译器（另见 [compiler-based "
"highlighting](https://blog.jetbrains.com/scala/2021/07/27/intellij-scala-plugin-2021-2/#Compiler-based_highlighting)）。"
"许多用户满意这种体验，但依代码库不同，部分编译错误可能为误报，与生成源码的插件配合也可能不佳，"
"且您可能希望与 sbt 完全一致的构建语义。所幸现代 IntelliJ 通过 [Build Server Protocol](https://build-server-protocol.github.io/)（BSP）"
"支持包括 sbt 在内的其他 _构建服务器_。"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:48
msgid ""
"The benefit of using Build Server Protocol (BSP) with IntelliJ is that "
"you're using sbt to do the actual build work, so if you are the kind of "
"programmer who had sbt session up on the side, this avoids double "
"compilation."
msgstr ""
"在 IntelliJ 中使用 BSP 的好处是由 sbt 承担实际构建，因此若您习惯在旁边开着 sbt 会话，可避免重复编译。"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:83
msgid "To use sbt as build server on IntelliJ:"
msgstr ""
"要在 IntelliJ 上将 sbt 用作构建服务器："

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:85
msgid "Install Scala plugin on the Plugins tab."
msgstr ""
"在插件页安装 Scala 插件。"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:86
msgid ""
"To use the BSP approach, close IntelliJ, and remove exising `.idea` "
"directory, if any."
msgstr ""
"若采用 BSP 方式，请关闭 IntelliJ，并删除已存在的 `.idea` 目录（如有）。"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:87
msgid "From the terminal, run `sbt bspConfig` to generate `.bsp` directory."
msgstr ""
"在终端运行 `sbt bspConfig` 以生成 `.bsp` 目录。"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:88
msgid ""
"Open IntelliJ, and open a `build.sbt` file. Select **BSP project** when "
"prompted:<br> ![IntelliJ](../files/intellij_bsp.png)"
msgstr ""
"打开 IntelliJ，并打开 `build.sbt` 文件。出现提示时选择 **BSP project**：<br> ![IntelliJ](../files/intellij_bsp.png)"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:90
msgid ""
"Once the import process is complete, open a Scala file to see that code "
"completion works:<br> ![IntelliJ](../files/intellij11.png)"
msgstr ""
"导入完成后，打开 Scala 文件以确认代码补全可用：<br> ![IntelliJ](../files/intellij11.png)"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:93
msgid "Use the following setting to opt-out some of the subprojects from BSP."
msgstr ""
"使用以下设置可使部分子项目不参与 BSP。"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:99
msgid ""
"Open Preferences, search BSP and check \"build automatically on file save\", "
"and uncheck \"export sbt projects to Bloop before import\":<br> ![IntelliJ]"
"(../files/intellij12.png)"
msgstr ""
"打开 Preferences，搜索 BSP，勾选 \"build automatically on file save\"，并取消勾选 \"export sbt projects to Bloop before import\"："
"<br> ![IntelliJ](../files/intellij12.png)"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:102
msgid ""
"When you make changes to the code and save them (`Cmd-S` on macOS), IntelliJ "
"will invoke sbt to do the actual building work."
msgstr ""
"修改代码并保存（在 macOS 上为 `Cmd-S`）时，IntelliJ 会调用 sbt 执行实际构建。"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:105
msgid ""
"See also Igal Tabachnik's [Using BSP effectively in IntelliJ and Scala]"
"(https://hmemcpy.com/2021/09/bsp-and-intellij/) for more details."
msgstr ""
"更多说明另见 Igal Tabachnik 的 [Using BSP effectively in IntelliJ and Scala](https://hmemcpy.com/2021/09/bsp-and-intellij/)。"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:107
msgid "Logging into sbt session"
msgstr ""
"登录 sbt 会话"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:109
msgid "We can also log into the existing sbt session using the thin client."
msgstr ""
"您也可通过瘦客户端登录已有的 sbt 会话。"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:111
msgid ""
"From Terminal section, type in `sbt --client` ![IntelliJ](../files/"
"intellij6.png)"
msgstr ""
"在终端面板中输入 `sbt --client` ![IntelliJ](../files/intellij6.png)"

#: src/reference/recipes/import-to-intellij.md:114
msgid ""
"This lets you log into the sbt session IntelliJ has started. In there you "
"can call `testOnly` and other tasks with the code already compiled."
msgstr ""
"这样可登录 IntelliJ 已启动的 sbt 会话。在其中可调用 `testOnly` 等任务，且代码已编译。"
